<title>JAPAN: THAI RESCUE PACKAGE TO COST TOTAL OF $14 BLN - IMF.</title>
<headline>THAI RESCUE PACKAGE TO COST TOTAL OF $14 BLN - IMF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total cost of a multilateral economic package to shore up Thailand's ailing economy will be $14 billion, an IMF spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>He said although the cost of the package was $14 billion, participants at a donors' meeting pledged a total of $16 billion.</p>
</text>
